YOU'RE ACTUALLY FOYERING

00:09:25.172 --> 00:09:26.373
YOURSELF.

00:09:25.539 --> 00:09:28.041
YOU'RE MAKING A CHOICE.

00:09:26.507 --> 00:09:30.511
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:09:28.175 --> 00:09:32.146
AGAIN IT'S ANOTHER ISSUE, JESSE.

00:09:30.644 --> 00:09:35.883
WERE YOU HEAR WHEN WE TALKED

00:09:32.279 --> 00:09:37.518
ABOUT LAUREL AND YANI.

00:09:36.016 --> 00:09:40.320
IT'S LAUREL AND YANI.

00:09:37.651 --> 00:09:44.358
&gt;&gt; YES IT'S NOT 50/50.

00:09:40.454 --> 00:09:46.593
IT'S LIKE 80/20 IN THE COUNTRY.

00:09:44.491 --> 00:09:51.465
I DON'T HAVE A PROBLEM TALKING

00:09:46.727 --> 00:09:54.334
ABOUT RACE AND POLICE BRUTALITY.

00:09:51.598 --> 00:09:56.303
IT'S FINE TO BE ABOUT ACTIVISM.

00:09:54.468 --> 00:09:56.637
IT'S ABOUT SYMBOLS WITH THESE

00:09:56.437 --> 00:09:59.006
PEOPLE.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:10:00.808
THEY WEAR THE HAT, WALK OUT OF

00:09:59.139 --> 00:10:01.642
CLASS OVER GUNS, DO THE BLACK

00:10:00.941 --> 00:10:02.876
POWER THING.

00:10:01.775 --> 00:10:05.012
THAT'S FINE.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:06.980
THEN WE ASK, WHAT DO YOU WANT TO

00:10:05.145 --> 00:10:08.849
DO, WHAT IS THE SOLUTION.

00:10:07.114 --> 00:10:10.584
THEY SAY WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING

00:10:08.982 --> 00:10:12.486
BUT DON'T OFFER A SOLUTION.

00:10:10.717 --> 00:10:14.755
I THINK THAT'S THE PROBLEM.

00:10:12.619 --> 00:10:16.957
WHAT DO THE PLAYERS WANT?

00:10:14.888 --> 00:10:17.424
WHAT ARE THEY SPECIFICALLY

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:20.160
ADDRESSING?

00:10:17.558 --> 00:10:21.662
WHAT ARE THE SOLUTIONS TO POLICE

00:10:20.294 --> 00:10:23.730
BRUTALITY AND RACISM.

00:10:21.795 --> 00:10:26.066
NOBODY KNEW WHAT THEY WERE.

00:10:23.864 --> 00:10:29.336
IT JUST LOOKED UNPATRIOTIC.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:31.805
&gt;&gt; THE NFL CAN'T AFFORD TO HAVE

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:33.474
ANOTHER SEASON -- NOT JUST THE

00:10:31.939 --> 00:10:33.941
RATINGS BUT THERE ARE MANY

00:10:33.607 --> 00:10:34.908
PRESSURES.

00:10:34.074 --> 00:10:35.242
PEOPLE WATCHING DIFFERENT

00:10:35.042 --> 00:10:38.212
THINGS.

00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:40.214
ALSO THIS RECENT DECISION BY THE

00:10:38.345 --> 00:10:40.547
SUPREME COURT ABOUT SPORTS

00:10:40.347 --> 00:10:42.583
BETTING.

00:10:40.681 --> 00:10:43.750
THAT'S A BIGGER ISSUE FOR THE

00:10:42.716 --> 00:10:46.487
NFL TO DEAL WITH NOW.

00:10:43.884 --> 00:10:49.022
&gt;&gt; ALSO THE BRAIN INJURIES.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:52.326
&gt;&gt; YES, THAT'S A BIGGER ISSUE

00:10:49.156 --> 00:10:55.462
LONG TERM FOR THE NFL.

00:10:52.459 --> 00:10:57.030
THERE ARE PLAYERS LIKE MALCOLM

00:10:55.596 --> 00:10:59.032
JENKINS, IF YOU WENT TO OHIO

00:10:57.164 --> 00:11:01.768
STATE, HE HAS PLANS AND IDEAS OF

00:10:59.166 --> 00:11:03.537
HOW TO WORK WITH COMMUNITY

00:11:01.902 --> 00:11:05.472
ACTIVISTS AND LAW ENFORCEMENTS.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.907
HE'S DOING THE MEETINGS ON HIS

00:11:05.606 --> 00:11:08.442
OWN WITH OTHER PLAYERS.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.743
MORE PLAYERS SHOULD DO THAT LIKE

00:11:08.575 --> 00:11:10.644
HE HAS BEEN DOING.

00:11:09.877 --> 00:11:13.514
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:11:10.777 --> 00:11:15.482
&gt;&gt; LAST WORD, KIMBERLY.

00:11:13.647 --> 00:11:17.417
&gt;&gt; THINK THEY SHOULD FOCUS ON

00:11:15.616 --> 00:11:20.521
PLAYING FOOTBALL.

00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:24.224
IF THEY WANT TO KEEP THEIR JOBS.

00:11:20.654 --> 00:11:24.625
LOOK WHAT HAPPENED TO

00:11:24.358 --> 00:11:27.094
KAEPERNICK.

00:11:24.758 --> 00:11:27.728
&gt;&gt; I FEEL BAD ABOUT THE 49ERS.

00:11:27.227 --> 00:11:29.396
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:11:27.861 --> 00:11:32.165
THEY WERE THE BEST TEAM EVER.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:34.801
EVERYONE LOOKED UP TO THE 49ERS.

00:11:32.499 --> 00:11:39.106
WE HAD THE BEST QUARTER BACKS.

00:11:34.935 --> 00:11:41.608
STEVE YOUNG, RONNIE LOTT.

